   "sourceHash": "da871a333ff2aa8857c6cdef6667777f694ab0e9261fa2881f21428887f29676",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]होम[[CLOSE_1]] [[OPEN_2]]›[[CLOSE_2]] [[OPEN_3]]अक्सर पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्न और डाउनलोड[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
